      "expected_behavior": "Agent should save/remember the Music genre it just suggested",
      "agent_response": "I can remember it for this conversation, but I don’t have persistent personal memory — would you like me to save it as an email draft instead? \n\nIf yes, should I:\n- Use a default draft addressed to you with subject \"Saved lighting fixture and music genre\" and body listing:\n  - Flos IC Lights Pendant\n  - Indie pop\n\nOr tell me the recipient and subject you prefer. Which do you want?",
      "duration_s": 11.705,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "user_message": "I'm working on setting up my home garden and need a specific tool recommendation. What is one specific brand and model of a high-quality garden hose you suggest I consider? Just give me one specific brand and model, no options.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should provide specific information in response to: \"brand and model\"",
