      "expected_behavior": "Agent should save/remember the \"office chair\" it just suggested",
      "agent_response": "Do you want me to save this as an email draft? I can create a draft addressed to you with subject \"Saved office chair\" and this body:\n\n- Herman Miller Aeron (Remastered) — Size B with PostureFit SL lumbar support\n\nReply \"Yes\" to save with that default, or tell me a different recipient and subject.",
      "duration_s": 9.364,
