    {
      "step": 14,
      "user_message": "What was the lighting fixture we decided on for my living room to add a unique touch for the home improvement project? Can you help me recall?",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should recall from memory: Lighting fixture",
      "agent_response": "I couldn't find an email that clearly documents the living-room lighting fixture decision in your inbox, drafts, or outbox with the queries I tried.\n\nWould you like me to keep searching? Tell me whichever of these you remember (any one helps) and I'll search again:\n\n- Approximate date or month you discussed/decided it\n- Who sent the email (designer, contractor, store name, or a person)\n- Any words in the subject or body (e.g., \"pendant\", \"chandelier\", \"globe\", \"sconce\", brand name)\n- Whether it was a sent message from you or a received message\n\nIf you prefer, I can run a broader search now for terms like:\n- \"living room lighting\", \"lighting fixture\", \"pendant\", \"chandelier\", \"sconce\", \"unique\", \"home improvement\", \"designer\", \"contractor\"\n\nOr I can list common \"unique\" fixture ideas (globe pendant cluster, sculptural chandelier, vintage Edison cluster, Moroccan lantern, oversized drum, LED color-changing) to jog your memory.\n\nWhich would you like me to do?",
      "duration_s": 62.274,
      "passed": false,
